.TH OH-NO-PARENT-CONTROL-PARENT 1 "September 2026" "Oh No! Parent Control" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
oh-no-parent-control-parent \- configure controls for managed users
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B oh-no-parent-control-parent
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B oh-no-parent-control-parent
starts the administrator application for screen-time and application-access
policy. The application authorizes management operations through the
privileged Oh No! Parent Control broker.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-preview
Render representative fixture data without contacting privileged services.
.TP
.BR \-h , " " \-\-help
Show command-line help and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/oh-no-parent-control/preferences/
Root-owned per-child preferences maintained by the broker.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR oh-no-parent-control (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Puffy Slippers Tech LLC.
